# Upstream ERT tests that must pass under clemacs (names as in ert-tests.el).
#
# Keep this list monotonic during bring-up; move temporary failures to
# `ert-upstream.known-fail.tests` with a short reason + date.
#
# NOTE: `ert-test-abc`/`ert-test-def` are defined dynamically inside
# `ert-test-deftest`; they aren't registered at load time, so we do not treat
# them as standalone bring-up targets.
ert-test-body-runs
ert-test-nested-test-body-runs
ert-test-pass
ert-test-fail
ert-test-fail-debug-with-debugger-1
ert-test-fail-debug-with-debugger-2
ert-test-fail-debug-nested-with-debugger
ert-test-error
ert-test-should
ert-test-should-not
ert-test-should-error-argument
ert-test-should-error-macroexpansion
